# builtin-read-chunk: read bytes in chunks from a string-handle
# Verifies: partial read (3 of 5 bytes), remainder read, bytes-str conversion
[h: [string-handle "hello"]]
[chunk: [builtin-read-chunk h 3]]
[rest: [builtin-read-chunk h 3]]
[str [bytes-str chunk] "/" [bytes-str rest]]
=== out
String("hel/lo")

=== warn
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: builtin-read-chunk
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: builtin-read-chunk
[UnificationFailure] cannot unify Bytes with <error>
[UnificationFailure] cannot unify Bytes with <error>
